## Slide 4

Women’s Health is the diagnosis and treatment of physical, mental and emotional conditions suffered by a woman. 
How serious is it ?
48.1% women aged 15-49 in the United States use contraceptives [3]
There are 6 million unplanned American pregnancies per year – imagine how many on a global scale [2]

Women’s Health – A Global Crisis!

