## Slide 15

Market

School Based Health Centers (US, 2020)
Addressing misconceptions and providing training for LARC counseling and insertion improved staff knowledge 
Comfort in Liletta IUD insertion increased from 16% to 27% [9]
Primary Care (US, 2020)
Provision increased 22.5% to 35% for IUDs and 31.5% to 49% for implants.
Same-day IUD insertion increased 26% to 35%
Knowledge of IUD eligibility rose from 69% to 84% [10]

